# Examples that deliberately have no gallery figure, one
# "script.py: reason" per line. A reason is mandatory, and an entry naming
# no script, or a script that IS in GALLERY_SCRIPTS, fails
# scripts/check_user_docs.py. Every other example is a gallery script.
#
# This is a decision, not a debt: it may grow when a new example has
# nothing worth plotting. Undecided examples sit in docs/.user-docs-exempt.
coarse_doppler_bank_demo.py: prints the bank geometry and one detection; the bank's figures are on the burst-bank design page
custom_block_demo.py: builds the argv a CLI pipeline spawns; there is no signal to draw
halfband_r2c_demo.py: prints the tone it shifted and the mirror it rejected; the resampling guide has the figures
ofdm_demo.py: checks the grid by transforming the signal back and prints the numbers; the spectrum and EVM figures belong to the modulator's characterization (#3117)
wfmgen_ofdm_demo.py: checks each PPDU against Wlan.ppdu and prints the verdicts; the spectrum and mask figures belong to the ofdm characterization (#3190)
wlan_rates_demo.py: prints a table of symbol counts and airtimes; the guide carries it and there is no signal to draw until the PPDU renderer reaches Python
state_filter_ramp_demo.py: prints two steady phase errors and a bandwidth; the two traces are drawn by the object's validation report (ramp.png) and the tracking-loops guide section carries the two numbers
state_filter_kalman_demo.py: prints a bandwidth and two settling counts; the guide section carries them
